  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Colombian Truth Commision</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Colombian Truth Commission to fulfil its mandate to reach out, get in touch with and collect testimonies of victims who left the country due to the armed conflict. Caritas Norway, being the agreement partner, will be implementing the project together with the Colombian Truth Commission, Instituto Catal&#xe1;n Internacional para
la Paz (Icip, Spain), Noref Centre for Conflict Resolution, and partners
from Colombia forum.</narrative>
  </description>
